WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.728 --> 00:00:02.942
- Chloe, are you okay in there?

00:00:02.942 --> 00:00:05.207
Do you need any help?

00:00:05.207 --> 00:00:06.697
I'm coming in.

00:00:06.697 --> 00:00:10.030
Honey, what the (beep)?

00:00:11.883 --> 00:00:13.987
Yeah, this meeting is
gonna be about two hours.

00:00:13.987 --> 00:00:15.862
Are you sure you don't
have to go to the bathroom?

00:00:15.862 --> 00:00:16.695
- Yeah, I'm sure.

00:00:16.695 --> 00:00:17.666
- Do you wanna just try?

00:00:17.666 --> 00:00:18.499
I can take you.

00:00:18.499 --> 00:00:19.409
It's not a big deal.

00:00:19.409 --> 00:00:21.092
Hey Chloe, remember what we talked about

00:00:21.092 --> 00:00:23.849
with the printer, how it's
really nice to take turns?

00:00:23.849 --> 00:00:25.794
Why don't we let someone else use it?

00:00:25.794 --> 00:00:27.675
And then you can come back
when they're finished.

00:00:27.675 --> 00:00:29.309
- Why don't we go around and talk about

00:00:29.309 --> 00:00:31.992
what some of our strengths
were this quarter?

00:00:31.992 --> 00:00:33.202
- [Voiceover] Well, I think.

00:00:33.202 --> 00:00:34.929
- Whoa, whoa, okay.

00:00:34.929 --> 00:00:37.729
Why don't we raise our
hands if we want to speak?

00:00:37.729 --> 00:00:39.279
- You wanna grab some lunch?

00:00:39.279 --> 00:00:41.264
- Um, you can get lunch
after you've cleaned

00:00:41.264 --> 00:00:42.523
your desk up a little bit.

00:00:42.523 --> 00:00:45.576
It'll be so nice to come
back to a nice clean desk.

00:00:45.576 --> 00:00:47.249
Oh, I can get those crusts for you.

00:00:47.249 --> 00:00:49.135
Here, hold on.

00:00:49.135 --> 00:00:50.407
No more crusts.

00:00:50.407 --> 00:00:51.657
Bye-bye, crust!

00:00:52.768 --> 00:00:54.017
- You're kidding me.

00:00:54.017 --> 00:00:55.972
(beep)

00:00:55.972 --> 00:00:56.805
- Language!

00:00:56.805 --> 00:00:57.907
Oh my goodness.

00:00:57.907 --> 00:01:00.119
I am so sorry that she
spoke to you that way.

00:01:00.119 --> 00:01:01.622
It will never happen again.

00:01:01.622 --> 00:01:03.624
- Alright guys, that about wraps it up.

00:01:03.624 --> 00:01:05.077
Ah, thanks for coming.

00:01:05.077 --> 00:01:06.209
We'll touch back next week.

00:01:06.209 --> 00:01:07.339
(clap, clap, clap)

00:01:07.339 --> 00:01:08.615
- I am so proud of you.

00:01:08.615 --> 00:01:11.630
Oh my gosh, he worked so
hard on this presentation.

00:01:11.630 --> 00:01:12.534
You rocked it.

00:01:12.534 --> 00:01:14.620
Come here, sweetheart.

00:01:14.620 --> 00:01:15.978
Did you wash your hands?

00:01:15.978 --> 00:01:16.811
- Yeah.

00:01:16.811 --> 00:01:17.981
- Let me smell.

00:01:17.981 --> 00:01:19.925
(sniff)

00:01:19.925 --> 00:01:21.122
You lied to me.

00:01:21.122 --> 00:01:22.474
Time out.

00:01:22.474 --> 00:01:25.188
Time out, I'm so disappointed in you.

00:01:25.188 --> 00:01:26.805
- Can I borrow your phone charger?

00:01:26.805 --> 00:01:28.985
- Hmm, what's the magic word?

00:01:28.985 --> 00:01:30.862
- Abracadabra.

00:01:30.862 --> 00:01:32.244
- No.

00:01:32.244 --> 00:01:34.661
Hey, let me get that for you.

00:01:35.800 --> 00:01:36.758
There you go.

00:01:36.758 --> 00:01:37.631
All better.

00:01:37.631 --> 00:01:38.908
- Alright, see you tomorrow.

00:01:38.908 --> 00:01:40.156
- Oh, okay, drive safely.

00:01:40.156 --> 00:01:42.319
And get to bed at a reasonable hour.

00:01:42.319 --> 00:01:43.626
No snacks after eight p.m.

00:01:43.626 --> 00:01:44.713
I love you.

00:01:44.713 --> 00:01:47.213
(jazzy music)

